TI  - RESURGENCE, HABIRO ELEMENTS AND STRANGE IDENTITIES
DA  - D:20250413
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.07001
AB  - We prove resurgence properties for the Borel transform of a formal power series associated to elements in the Habiro ring that come from radial limits of partial theta series via strange identities. As an application, we prove a conjecture in quantum topology due to Costin and Garoufalidis for two families of torus knots.
